{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28060","headline":"缑山月夜闻王子晋吹笙 · 锺辂","name":"缑山月夜闻王子晋吹笙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月满缑山夜，风传子晋笙。\n初闻盈谷远，渐听入云清。\n杳异人间曲，遥分鹤上情。\n孤鸾惊欲舞，万籁寂无声。\n此夕留烟驾，何时返玉京？\n唯愁音响绝，晓色出都城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"锺辂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}